# The light Wild OS scheme, from the README's light mode rules: ink #151b2c
# on near-white glass, accent deepened to #3563d8 with white text on it.
# Glass tokens are translucent; these are their solid equivalents over the
# light ground #eef1f7. Not selected anywhere yet: Settings will switch to it
# (with the WildOSLight Kvantum theme) when light mode ships.
#
#   ink #151b2c         ink-muted ~#616672    ground #eef1f7
#   accent #3563d8      on-accent #ffffff     accent-text #2a55c4

